          prompt: "In the reaction 2Al + 3Cu²⁺ → 2Al³⁺ + 3Cu, how many total electrons are transferred per formula unit of the balanced equation as written?",
          choices: ["2 electrons", "3 electrons", "6 electrons", "9 electrons"],
