  choices: ['Kw = 7.0, representing the neutral pH value', 'Kw = 1.0 × 10⁻¹⁴, representing the product [H⁺][OH⁻] in any aqueous solution at 25°C', 'Kw = 14, the sum of pH and pOH', 'Kw = 1.0 × 10⁻⁷, the concentration of H⁺ in pure water'],
