  choices: ['c_metal ≈ 4.18 J/(g·°C)', 'c_metal ≈ 0.597 J/(g·°C)', 'c_metal ≈ 2.09 J/(g·°C)', 'c_metal ≈ 0.299 J/(g·°C)'],
